    "http": "# v1 API — Generated from OpenAPI spec\n\n@host = http://localhost/api\n@token = Bearer {{token}}\n\n### Save a layout\nPOST {{host}}/v1/nested/save\nContent-Type: application/json\n\n{\n    \"key\": \"\",\n    \"widgets\": [],\n    \"abilities\": []\n}\n\n### Show a record\nGET {{host}}/v1/nested/show\n",
    "markdown": "# Nested API\nDot- and bracket-notation corner cases (v1)\n\n**Base URL:** `http://localhost/api`\n\n## Table of Contents\n\n- [nested](#nested)\n\n## nested\n\n### Save a layout\n\n`POST /v1/nested/save`\n\n**Request Body:**\n\nContent-Type: `application/json`\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `key` | string | Yes | Layout key |\n| `widgets` | array | Yes | Widgets, declared after their fields |\n| `abilities` | array | No | Abilities |\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n\n### Show a record\n\n`GET /v1/nested/show`\n\n**Responses:**\n\n- `200` — Response payload\n\n---\n",
    "curl": "#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# Nested API\nDot- and bracket-notation corner cases (v1) — cURL examples\n# Auto-generated from OpenAPI spec. Do not edit manually.\n\nBASE_URL=\"http://localhost/api\"\nTOKEN=\"${API_TOKEN:-}\"\n\n# Save a layout\ncurl -s -X POST \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"key\":\"\",\"widgets\":[],\"abilities\":[]}' \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/nested/save\"\n\n# Show a record\ncurl -s -X GET \\\n  \"${BASE_URL}/v1/nested/show\"\n",
